==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Ultra Prism|Drifblim|52}} from the {{TCG|Ultra Prism}} expansion.
*This card's {{TCGP|Promo-B}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Astral Radiance|Drifblim|64}} from the {{TCG|Astral Radiance}} expansion.
*'''Balloon Barrage''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|XY|Wigglytuff|90}} from the {{TCG|XY}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

